      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "利用公式$(1)$和$(2)$，依次得到：",
        "$A_n^1=n$，$A_n^2=n(n-1)$，$A_n^3=n(n-1)(n-2)$，",
        "$A_n^m=n(n-1)(n-2)\\cdots(n-m+1)$. $(3)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "但是，从$n$到$n-m+1$，$m$个逐次递减的自然数的乘积等",
        "于数$n$的阶乘与数$n-m$的阶乘之比（参看第$34$题б)）：",
        "$n(n-1)(n-2)\\cdots(n-m+1)=\\frac{n!}{(n-m)!}$.",
        "因此，最后得到公式：",
        "$A_n^m=\\frac{n!}{(n-m)!}$. $(4)$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "当$m=0$时，由公式$(4)$得到：",
        "$A_n^0=1$.",
        "这个等式是对的：空集只有一个，它是任何集合的子集，而且",
        "我们规定，空集有唯一的排列方法. 对于满足不等式",
        "$0\\leqslant m\\leqslant n$",
        "的任意整数$m$和$n$，公式$(3)$和$(4)$都适用."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这就是$n\\leqslant5$时，$A_n^m$的数值表."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
